      "text": "A gradient boosting framework that is designed\nto be more efficient than other implementations\n\nApplications:\n- predicting flight time for airlines\n- predicting cholesterol levels based on\n   health data",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A gradient boosting framework that is designed\nto be more efficient than other implementations\n\nApplications:\n- predicting flight time for airlines\n- predicting cholesterol levels based on\n   health data",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
