      "text": "PROS:\n- computes a probability for an observation\n   belonging to a cluster\n- can identify overlapping clusters\n- more accurate results compared to K-means",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PROS:\n- computes a probability for an observation\n   belonging to a cluster\n- can identify overlapping clusters\n- more accurate results compared to K-means",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
